    <note type="project" target="#dat1">This draft was likely composed and edited in the weeks before its first publication in the <hi rend="italic">Herald</hi>, sometime in late April or early May, 1888</note>
    
     <note type="work_relations" cert="high" target="xxx.00315">This manuscript contains a draft version of a poem entitled "A Carol at 69," which was first published in the <hi rend="italic">New York Herald</hi> on May 21, 1888 under the title "A Carol Closing Sixty-Nine." The poem then appeared under the latter title in <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi> later that same year.</note>
